[node name="LooksTv" type="Node3D" unique_id=431684148]
editor_description = "assets/27: the TV's Looks (tv-and-radio.md, Looks contracts): the old widescreen set on its walnut and cream console at its modelled size, the origin at the bottom centre, the front +Z. Glass (16:9, in the group no_outline: the outline never covers the picture) wears the CRT glass shader, whose feed TvScreen sets; PowerLight the standby lamp. Clips, as the old TvScreen and Device: on (the picture opens from a line over 0.25 s from wherever it was, the lamp glows at once), off (it collapses to a line and the glass goes dark over 0.25 s, the lamp out), static (0.6 s of static, opening the picture over 0.25 s if it was off, the lamp on)."

